  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Set air fryer to 200°C.\n• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat base over medium-high heat.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369d9b42dc4b928197e454/step-2bcc5000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice pear into thin sticks.\n• Using a vegetable peeler, peel carrot into ribbons.\n• In a large bowl, combine sriracha, sesame dressing, the soy sauce and a drizzle of olive oil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369d9b42dc4b928197e454/step-12b20410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Just before serving, to the bowl with the dressing, add shredded cabbage mix, mixed salad leaves, pear and carrot. Toss to coat and season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68369d9b42dc4b928197e454/step-557f4020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slice plant-based crumbed chicken Divide superquick plant-based crumbed chicken and sesame-sriracha salad between plates to serve. Enjoy!",
